  copy: "M10 8h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-8a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2zM16 8V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2",
